{"id":"633210","name":"猪肉粉丝包","author":"丽彩（五谷杂粮）","authorId":"12357987","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/633210/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉酱","amount":"大半碗"},{"name":"番薯粉丝","amount":"一团"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱","amount":"一把"},{"name":"水","amount":"275克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"4克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"食材备用。","img":"images/633210/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"粉丝用开水浸泡变软。","img":"images/633210/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切碎淋上酱油搅拌均匀。","img":"images/633210/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱切碎和粉丝放入提前炒好的肉酱中。","img":"images/633210/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"搅拌均匀备用。","img":"images/633210/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"克面粉，加4克酵母，少量白糖。","img":"images/633210/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"混合均匀后用275克水和面。","img":"images/633210/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"和成光滑面团。","img":"images/633210/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"撮长条。","img":"images/633210/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"切剂子。","img":"images/633210/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"擀面皮。","img":"images/633210/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放上适量的馅。","img":"images/633210/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"利用左手和右手食指根拇指收口。","img":"images/633210/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"包好的包子胚静置醒发至明显体积变大。","img":"images/633210/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"再开火蒸十五分钟，焖几分钟再取出。","img":"images/633210/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}